{
  "name": "AI Receptionist - Reservation Calendar Sync",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Receptionist - Reservation Calendar Sync\n\nOne webhook, three branches, driven by the `event` field the ai-receptionist backend sends:\n\n- **created** — makes a Google Calendar event with the caller as an attendee and `sendUpdates: all`, so Google itself emails them a calendar invite (Accept/Decline and all). Returns the created event's id in the webhook response; ai-receptionist stores it against the reservation so update/cancel can find the same event later.\n- **updated** — updates that same event's time/guest count using the calendar_event_id ai-receptionist sends back to us.\n- **cancelled** — deletes that event (Google emails the attendee a cancellation automatically).\n\nThis mirrors the restaurant_reception_workflow.json pattern (webhook -> Code parse -> branch -> respond) from the Vapi/n8n project, just pointed at Google Calendar instead of Google Sheets.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 620
      },
      "id": "b1a1b1a1-0001-4a01-8001-000000000001",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### EDIT ME\n\n- `calendarId` below — which Google Calendar to book into (defaults to `primary`, the account's own calendar).\n- On the three **Google Calendar** nodes: select/create a **Google Calendar OAuth2** credential (Google Cloud Console -> enable Calendar API -> OAuth consent + client -> n8n picks up the redirect URI automatically).\n- Set `N8N_RESERVATION_WEBHOOK_URL` in ai-receptionist's `.env` to this workflow's **Production URL** from the Webhook node below, once this workflow is Active.\n\nThe Google Calendar node's exact fields can vary a little by n8n version — if the imported node shows a red warning, open it and re-pick Calendar/Start/End/Attendees from its dropdowns; the values already typed in should still be correct.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 340
      },
      "id": "b1a1b1a1-0002-4a01-8001-000000000002",
      "name": "Edit Me Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 340]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "reservation-event",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1a1b1a1-0003-4a01-8001-000000000003",
      "name": "1. Webhook - Reservation Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [240, 340],
      "webhookId": "b1a1b1a1-0003-4a01-8001-000000000003"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "cfg1", "name": "calendarId", "type": "string", "value": "primary" },
            { "id": "cfg2", "name": "durationMinutes", "type": "number", "value": 90 }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1a1b1a1-0004-4a01-8001-000000000004",
      "name": "CONFIG (EDIT ME)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [464, 340]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const cfg = $('CONFIG (EDIT ME)').first().json;\nconst body = $('1. Webhook - Reservation Event').first().json.body || {};\n\nconst start = new Date(body.starts_at);\nconst end = new Date(start.getTime() + cfg.durationMinutes * 60000);\n\nconst summary = `Reservation #${body.reservation_id} - ${body.name} (${body.guests_count} guests)`;\nconst description = `Booked via AI receptionist for ${body.business_name}.\\nReservation ID: ${body.reservation_id}\\nPhone: ${body.phone || 'n/a'}`;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    event: body.event,\n    reservationId: body.reservation_id,\n    calendarEventId: body.calendar_event_id || null,\n    email: body.email || null,\n    summary,\n    description,\n    startIso: start.toISOString(),\n    endIso: end.toISOString(),\n    calendarId: cfg.calendarId\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "b1a1b1a1-0005-4a01-8001-000000000005",
      "name": "2. Parse Reservation Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [688, 340]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 },
          "conditions": [
            { "id": "evc1", "leftValue": "={{ $json.event }}", "rightValue": "created", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" } }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1a1b1a1-0006-4a01-8001-000000000006",
      "name": "3. Event == created?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [912, 340]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 },
          "conditions": [
            { "id": "evc2", "leftValue": "={{ $json.event }}", "rightValue": "updated", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" } }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1a1b1a1-0007-4a01-8001-000000000007",
      "name": "4. Event == updated?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1136, 540]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "event",
        "operation": "create",
        "calendar": { "__rl": true, "mode": "list", "value": "={{ $json.calendarId }}" },
        "start": "={{ $json.startIso }}",
        "end": "={{ $json.endIso }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "summary": "={{ $json.summary }}",
          "description": "={{ $json.description }}",
          "attendees": "={{ $json.email ? [$json.email] : [] }}",
          "sendUpdates": "all"
        }
      },
      "id": "b1a1b1a1-0008-4a01-8001-000000000008",
      "name": "5a. Create Calendar Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendar",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [1136, 220],
      "credentials": {
        "googleCalendarOAuth2Api": { "id": "REPLACE_ME", "name": "Google Calendar account" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const created = $input.first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { calendar_event_id: created.id || created.iCalUID || null } }];"
      },
      "id": "b1a1b1a1-0009-4a01-8001-000000000009",
      "name": "5b. Format Create Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1360, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "event",
        "operation": "update",
        "calendar": { "__rl": true, "mode": "list", "value": "={{ $('2. Parse Reservation Payload').item.json.calendarId }}" },
        "eventId": "={{ $('2. Parse Reservation Payload').item.json.calendarEventId }}",
        "updateFields": {
          "start": "={{ $('2. Parse Reservation Payload').item.json.startIso }}",
          "end": "={{ $('2. Parse Reservation Payload').item.json.endIso }}",
          "summary": "={{ $('2. Parse Reservation Payload').item.json.summary }}",
          "sendUpdates": "all"
        }
      },
      "id": "b1a1b1a1-0010-4a01-8001-000000000010",
      "name": "6a. Update Calendar Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendar",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [1360, 460],
      "credentials": {
        "googleCalendarOAuth2Api": { "id": "REPLACE_ME", "name": "Google Calendar account" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return [{ json: { ok: true } }];"
      },
      "id": "b1a1b1a1-0011-4a01-8001-000000000011",
      "name": "6b. Format Update Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1584, 460]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "event",
        "operation": "delete",
        "calendar": { "__rl": true, "mode": "list", "value": "={{ $('2. Parse Reservation Payload').item.json.calendarId }}" },
        "eventId": "={{ $('2. Parse Reservation Payload').item.json.calendarEventId }}",
        "options": { "sendUpdates": "all" }
      },
      "id": "b1a1b1a1-0012-4a01-8001-000000000012",
      "name": "7a. Delete Calendar Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendar",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [1360, 680],
      "credentials": {
        "googleCalendarOAuth2Api": { "id": "REPLACE_ME", "name": "Google Calendar account" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return [{ json: { ok: true } }];"
      },
      "id": "b1a1b1a1-0013-4a01-8001-000000000013",
      "name": "7b. Format Cancel Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1584, 680]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1a1b1a1-0014-4a01-8001-000000000014",
      "name": "8. Respond",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1808, 340]
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "connections": {
